(wgs84-drop)
*title WGS-84 gravity drop
*atmos none
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=100000 long=0 lat=0 vel=0 gama=-90 psi=0 time=0 mass=1
  *file gravity.dat time alt vel altdt xecfc yecfc zecfc
  *segment 1 drop
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05
    *when time=10 stop
*end
